{'symbol': 'LLY', 'date': '2023-01-20 09:00:00', 'title': 'US FDA ACCEPTS SUPPLEMENTAL NEW DRUG APPLICATION FOR JARDIANCE® FOR ADULTS WITH CHRONIC KIDNEY DISEASE', 'text': 'THE SUPPLEMENTAL NEW DRUG APPLICATION IS BASED ON RESULTS FROM THE LANDMARK EMPA-KIDNEY PHASE III TRIAL, WHICH SHOWED JARDIANCE® (EMPAGLIFLOZIN) TABLETS SIGNIFICANTLY REDUCED THE RISK OF KIDNEY DISEASE PROGRESSION* OR CARDIOVASCULAR DEATH IN ADULTS WITH CKD BY 28% (ABSOLUTE RISK REDUCTION [ARR]: 3.8%) COMPARED WITH PLACEBO, BOTH ON TOP OF STANDARD OF CARE. RIDGEFIELD, CONN.'}